    "sources": {
      "xray": "https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/releases",
      "sing_box": "https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box/releases"
    },
    "archMappingNote": "各目标所需的核心产物架构由本表 assetArch 字段声明；实际文件名与校验和由 versions.lock.json 锁定，不在本文件伪造。"
  },

